WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.690
Dr Solveig Adeyemi is a lecturer at Slop University.

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:10.980
In emergency services, I saw how few reports ever reached an agenda.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.420
Now I follow a report from whoever writes it

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:15.980
to whoever decides.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.770
At each handoff, I track what gets dropped.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.410
A library door that kept squeaking,

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.910
filed as a hazard.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:25.640
A childcare network's incident notes,

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.890
and what changes on the next shift.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:32.427
A reply-all storm on a netball mailing list.

00:00:32.727 --> 00:00:35.067
No lecturer at Slop University has published more.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:38.197
Two hundred and sixty-five research outputs,

00:00:38.397 --> 00:00:40.737
and one thousand and ninety-five citations.

00:00:41.537 --> 00:00:43.377
Someone always notices first.

00:00:43.677 --> 00:00:45.737
I want to know where their report goes.

00:00:46.937 --> 00:00:48.227
There's more on our website,

00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:49.177
on Bluesky,

00:00:49.327 --> 00:00:50.147
and by email.
